WEBVTT

NOTE
Estimated timing, not word-aligned. Spoken chapter cues are authoritative.

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:14.083
Chapter 1. Beneath the Same Dawn. A northern research expedition
finds a mystery beneath the ice while Yan's protected family
beginning unfolds elsewhere.

2
00:00:14.083 --> 00:00:24.875
Chapter 2. Warm Hands. Family safeguards and institute housing bring
Yan and Lan Xuanyu together through an ordinary, quietly
extraordinary childhood.

3
00:00:24.875 --> 00:00:34.708
Chapter 3. The Shape Inside. Awakening reveals Yan's juvenile Fire
Phoenix, before any soul ring or bonded soul spirit has been
acquired.

4
00:00:34.708 --> 00:00:45.833
Chapter 4. The First Record. School registration creates the first
public records while friendship must survive different classes and
hidden family truths.

5
00:00:45.833 --> 00:00:56.708
Chapter 5. The Weight Between Them. School rivalry and physical
tests teach restraint as Yan reaches the first bottleneck without
acquiring a ring yet.

6
00:00:56.708 --> 00:01:06.625
Chapter 6. The Right Wings. Yan bonds legally with the flawed
Dawnflame Kite, gaining the first yellow ring and an unmastered
first skill.

7
00:01:06.625 --> 00:01:15.458
Chapter 7. What Came Home. The return journey brings Nana into Lan's
home while Yan's first living bond continues to settle.

8
00:01:15.458 --> 00:01:27.208
Chapter 8. The Bell After the Sky. School resumes around public
tests and private danger, with Lan's abnormality drawing attention
that adults must carefully manage.

9
00:01:27.208 --> 00:01:39.166
Chapter 9. Three Months of Quiet Fire. Quiet months of training
deepen foundations while distant performances and family absences
change the children's emotional world.

10
00:01:39.167 --> 00:01:50.125
Chapter 10. The Building That Held Its Breath. The Horizon Building
crisis makes danger immediate; rescue and its aftermath give Lan new
reasons to train.

11
00:01:50.125 --> 00:01:59.875
Chapter 11. The Tenth Name. Nana's departure and the Elite Junior
Class pathway turn loss into preparation for a much harder school
life.

12
00:01:59.875 --> 00:02:10.500
Chapter 12. The Forest That Answered. A simulated forest assessment
exposes the cost of survival, and Lan's mental injury leaves his
friends waiting.

13
00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:21.375
Chapter 13. The Seat That Waited. Lan wakes, a concert changes his
world, and the academy transition creates new dormitory teams and
obligations.

14
00:02:21.375 --> 00:02:33.083
Chapter 14. The Fire That Did Not Step In. Yan refuses to turn every
conflict into a personal intervention while classmates learn what
teamwork will demand.

15
00:02:33.083 --> 00:02:44.166
Chapter 15. The First Coin. Dorm333's first Soul World challenge
exposes broken formation, unreliable summoning and the real cost of
earning a coin.

16
00:02:44.167 --> 00:02:56.459
Chapter 16. The Door That Answered. The summoning gate answers with
an ice-wielding girl, revealing possibilities that depend on
coordination rather than certainty.

17
00:02:56.458 --> 00:03:08.000
Chapter 17. The Question at the Table. A cafeteria question and
another gate test show how dangerous secrets can hide inside
ordinary school conversation.

18
00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:18.417
Chapter 18. The Bright Edge. Repeated summoning tests reveal limits
and connections, while Yan learns to keep fire and light under
control.

19
00:03:18.417 --> 00:03:31.209
Chapter 19. The Question No Teacher Should Hear. Teacher Ji's
lessons bring special colors and dangerous questions into focus
without granting anyone knowledge they have not earned.

20
00:03:31.208 --> 00:03:41.666
Chapter 20. The Answer Behind the Door. Lan seeks a private answer
through Nana's message route as the next physical examination begins
to close in.

21
00:03:41.667 --> 00:03:52.459
Chapter 21. The Meaning of a Plus Sign. Midterm results and
protected plus signs lead into the Maze, where a team's judgment
matters as much as strength.

22
00:03:52.458 --> 00:04:03.416
Chapter 22. The Quietest Place. The Maze rewards concealment,
patience and careful positioning before the next confrontation
reaches its decisive exchange.

23
00:04:03.417 --> 00:04:13.084
Chapter 23. Ten Seconds. Ten decisive seconds test the teams, as
Yan's controlled fire follows a different path from Lan's hidden
answer.

24
00:04:13.083 --> 00:04:22.916
Chapter 24. Twenty Minutes. A private teacher's demanding simulation
leaves Lan exhausted while Yan measures the recovery cost of the
Maze.

25
00:04:22.917 --> 00:04:33.750
Chapter 25. The Second Weight. Yan's second soul-spirit process adds
a new structural foundation without turning a private truth into a
public reveal.

26
00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:44.708
Chapter 26. The Test That Chose a Target. The next test changes the
pressure on the teams, and the summoning gate prepares an answer not
yet understood.

27
00:04:44.708 --> 00:04:55.125
Chapter 27. The Door That Chose Twice. A Crocodile Dragon answers
one call; the next door brings the unexpected and dangerous Emerald
Demon Bird.

28
00:04:55.125 --> 00:05:07.125
Chapter 28. The Match They Were Allowed to See. A frighteningly
quick match changes what opponents know, forcing every later team to
prepare against a visible tactic.

29
00:05:07.125 --> 00:05:17.708
Chapter 29. The Defeat He Chose. Lan chooses concession rather than
gambling blindly, showing that a deliberate defeat need not mean a
broken team.

30
00:05:17.708 --> 00:05:29.750
Chapter 30. The Color Pressure Found. Pressure produces Lan's
colorful self-fusion-like answer, but another team's earned place
cannot simply disappear from the board.

31
00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:40.125
Chapter 31. The Match the Board Owed. Dorm336 finally receives the
match the board owed, preserving a real rival route before time is
allowed to move.

32
00:05:40.125 --> 00:05:52.042
Chapter 32. The Years That Learned to Wait. Training accumulates
across the time bridge, and the Purple Flame path becomes a named
possibility rather than an instant reward.

33
00:05:52.042 --> 00:06:03.584
Chapter 33. The Door That Became a Cocoon. Careful preparation
begins the protected cocoon process; the door closes around a
transformation nobody is allowed to hurry.

34
00:06:03.583 --> 00:06:14.083
Chapter 34. The Twenty-First Pulse. The twenty-first pulse brings
developing wing structure, but the shell remains closed and the
month is not yet over.

35
00:06:14.083 --> 00:06:25.666
Chapter 35. The Fire That Remembered Its Name. Earned emergence
completes the full Fire Phoenix awakening: red-gold wings open while
Yan's public identity stays intact.

36
00:06:25.667 --> 00:06:36.709
Chapter 36. The Year Between Wings and Stars. New wings demand new
teamwork and disciplined training while Lan's separate path reaches
the danger of real space.

37
00:06:36.708 --> 00:06:47.708
Chapter 37. The Dragon Outside the Window. The pirate crisis proves
that real space has no reset, while Yan continues training far away
on another planet.

38
00:06:47.708 --> 00:07:00.250
Chapter 38. Names Borrowed by Children. Reunions, borrowed names and
guarded conversations preserve childhood connections without
collapsing the walls around private knowledge.

39
00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:12.125
Chapter 39. A Vortex Learns to Hold. Nana protects Lan's
breakthrough to the second threshold while Yan's already earned
strength remains its own distinct foundation.

40
00:07:12.125 --> 00:07:23.958
Chapter 40. The Scan Before the Roar. Shrek's preliminary scan and
qualifier briefing place the children under institutional scrutiny
before the volcanic test begins.

41
00:07:23.958 --> 00:07:34.666
Chapter 41. No Loopholes in the Sky. Ground Fire Lizards and a much
greater dragon threat turn the qualifier into a test of coordination
and survival.

42
00:07:34.667 --> 00:07:45.875
Chapter 42. The Pool That Lied. False magma creates a narrow
opportunity while Dorm336 survives through its own earned team route
rather than forced failure.

43
00:07:45.875 --> 00:07:58.750
Chapter 43. Thirty Seconds of Green. Dorm333's dangerous opening and
Dorm336's controlled Fire Phoenix route remain different answers to
the same qualifier pressure.

44
00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:10.125
Chapter 44. The Door That Chose Three. An offer tests what
advancement is worth when personal opportunity threatens the bond
and future of a team.

45
00:08:10.125 --> 00:08:22.917
Chapter 45. Thanks, and the Score Not Yet Shown. Back outside the
simulation, thanks and guarded conversations arrive before anyone
has seen the final public score.

46
00:08:22.917 --> 00:08:33.917
Chapter 46. The Sea Opens Before the Crown. Lan remains in deep
meditation as Dorm333 takes first place and Dorm336's own route
earns second.

47
00:08:33.917 --> 00:08:46.000
Chapter 47. Five Hundred and Five. Lan wakes at five hundred and
five Spiritual Power, while adults seek answers his teammates will
not casually surrender.

48
00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:56.917
Chapter 48. The Line in the Stars. Yin Tianfan's account puts
ambition and consequence in perspective as the Lucky Wheel doorway
approaches.

49
00:08:56.917 --> 00:09:07.209
Chapter 49. No Pattern Underfoot. The Lucky Wheel gives Dorm333
distinct rewards, each carrying its own practical limits and next
responsibilities.

50
00:09:07.208 --> 00:09:19.333
Chapter 50. The Forest Counts Separately. Six teams enter the next
simulated forest round under separate scoring, random transfer and
rules that punish careless assumptions.

51
00:09:19.333 --> 00:09:29.916
Chapter 51. The Cost of Quiet. Training ambitions meet the pain and
practical costs of improvement as the trio changes how it moves
through the forest.

52
00:09:29.917 --> 00:09:40.584
Chapter 52. Amiable Beasts. A wounded golden ape and palm-type bear
guard a rooted immortal herb; the children withdraw without
resolving the stalemate.

